msgid "Customizing Micrometer"
msgstr ""

msgid "Quarkus provides a variety of way to customize Micrometer."
msgstr ""

msgid "Use <code>MeterFilter</code> to customize emitted tags and metrics"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Micrometer uses `MeterFilter` instances to customize the metrics emitted by "
"`MeterRegistry` instances.\n"
"The Micrometer extension will detect `MeterFilter` CDI beans and use them "
"when initializing `MeterRegistry`\n"
"instances."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"In this example, a singleton CDI bean will produce two different "
"`MeterFilter` beans.\n"
"One will be applied only to\n"
"Prometheus `MeterRegistry` instances (using the `@MeterFilterConstraint` "
"qualifier), and another will be applied\n"
"to all `MeterRegistry` instances.\n"
"An application configuration property is also injected and used as a tag "
"value.\n"
"Additional examples of MeterFilters can be found in the\n"
"link:https://docs.micrometer.io/micrometer/reference/concepts.html[official "
"documentation]."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
